Description: LCOS 0.3 XFCE desktop edition metapackage
 Pulls LCOS identity, XFCE look, Clearlooks, and Lunduke Themes. Recommends the
 XFCE/LightDM stack plus Zork and Micropolis. Does not depend on
 Calamares or live-config installer bits.
